Z||000000||pred1tor83||01-28-2001||03:57 PM||||Hey, anyone have any cheap tips (under $20.00) for a fiero.  Stuff like the chime box modificaitons.  Or for that matter anything under 100.00 like the cool "low profile" lights that are really cool (http://webhome.idirect.com/~rsm1/slim.jpg)<P><BR>thnx||||reg||2
Z||000001||DaRkLoRD||01-28-2001||04:26 PM||||You might be able to do flush mounted lights for under $100, but I'm not sure about the low profile popups.. the biggest problem I've encountered so far is not being able to find a dual filament light that's the right size.. (9" wide by about 4" high)<P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||1
Z||000002||noyb||01-28-2001||05:06 PM||||Flush mount headlights for around $100?  I'd be interested in more information on that, thanks.||||reg||1
Z||000003||Philphine||01-28-2001||05:45 PM||||stuff i did to my car that more or less falls in that range (if you haven't tried them already): speaker up grades, sub box and sub, hood and vents (that one could have been even less if i had been braver and used my original hood) and mustang wing. the last one was actualy $150 (new) and still needs paint but you could luck out and find a painted used one if you have a fairly common color. ||||reg||1
Z||000004||Seanh||01-28-2001||06:09 PM||||Check out the Fiero Cave (link at bottem of this page). There are some things to do there, like lighted window switches, auto-down window module, power door lock conversion, power mirrors, do-it-yourself things like that. <P>Headlights like these maybe?:<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/ralfy9862/waycool.jpg"> <P>Here's the write up on how to do it yourself: <A HREF="http://members.nccw.net/webe/other/fiero/lowprofile.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://members.nccw.net/webe/other/fiero/lowprofile.htm</A> <P>Pretty Awesome if ya ask me. I would highly reccomend you do it like that if you are going to do it. I dont want to sound like a pest, but useing fog lights (like most kits) is highly illegal. This is not what fog light were designed for, and will not give you as good visiblity as these will. I am going to do this to my car with HID lights as soon as I make sure Iv have the money to cover my 3.4 conversion before spending it all.||||reg||1
Z||000005||DXR_DAD||01-28-2001||06:20 PM||||Once I had the complete inside & out detailed at a local shop $150.00 kinda made me keep it the inside clean  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> and I like having a clean car. Maybe some things you already have could be replaced? dash fasicas,<BR>shift boot, ash trays & doors, floor mats, the little thing that make your fiero look nice.<P>DXR_DAD||||reg||1
